    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Term formerly used for a variety of bedcovers, especially those woven of cotton or wool; from the mid-19th century onwards generally replaced by the term "bedspreads." [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
